WEBVTT

00:01:44.580 --> 00:01:47.830
There is a need to check this, after all.

00:02:02.500 --> 00:02:04.520
Excuse me, Tina-san?

00:02:04.520 --> 00:02:05.730
Huh?!

00:02:06.000 --> 00:02:07.440
Mayucchi?

00:02:07.440 --> 00:02:12.940
Is it possible that you're hiding something from us?

00:02:12.940 --> 00:02:14.540
Hiding something?

00:02:14.540 --> 00:02:17.030
Not really, nothing at all.

00:02:18.080 --> 00:02:19.740
What's wrong, Mayu-chan?

00:02:22.050 --> 00:02:23.080
That is...

00:02:23.720 --> 00:02:26.720
The truth is I heard her.

00:02:26.720 --> 00:02:29.750
When we were at the spa resort before...

00:02:30.220 --> 00:02:34.050
she was talking on the phone
about going back to America!

00:02:34.050 --> 00:02:35.130
Eh!

00:02:35.130 --> 00:02:38.370
Eh?! Tina, is that true?

00:02:38.370 --> 00:02:40.100
T-That is...

00:02:40.100 --> 00:02:41.430
No, that is...

00:02:41.800 --> 00:02:42.930
Tina-senpai!

00:02:42.930 --> 00:02:43.860
Tina!

00:02:43.860 --> 00:02:45.260
Eh, no.

00:02:49.730 --> 00:02:50.940
Senpai?

00:02:50.940 --> 00:02:52.210
Hey, Tina.

00:02:57.950 --> 00:02:59.590
Oh, my stomach hurts.

00:02:59.590 --> 00:03:03.620
I was wondering what you'd say,
but going back to America?

00:03:05.660 --> 00:03:07.200
Why are you jumping the gun?

00:03:07.790 --> 00:03:10.560
That's why you get called a brat.

00:03:10.560 --> 00:03:12.250
W-What did you say?

00:03:12.500 --> 00:03:14.750
Back then, I'm sure you...

00:03:14.750 --> 00:03:15.960
Right.

00:03:15.960 --> 00:03:18.970
I sure did say that then.

00:03:18.970 --> 00:03:22.470
But we were talking about a year-end homecoming.

00:03:22.470 --> 00:03:24.410
H-Homecoming?

00:03:24.410 --> 00:03:29.230
Since you came back to Japan,
has your hearing gone bad{ or something}?

00:03:29.230 --> 00:03:30.280
Wha-

00:03:30.280 --> 00:03:33.980
Your English accent is too strong!

00:03:33.980 --> 00:03:36.980
What an awkward excuse that is!

00:03:39.090 --> 00:03:39.900
Why you!

00:03:42.830 --> 00:03:44.600
Wait, stop!

00:03:44.600 --> 00:03:46.780
I don't want to!

00:03:48.470 --> 00:03:51.330
Geez, don't scare me like that.

00:03:52.210 --> 00:03:53.960
Stop!

00:03:53.960 --> 00:03:56.380
I told you no!

00:04:08.460 --> 00:04:10.260
Kaoru, look, look!

00:04:10.260 --> 00:04:11.520
Tada!

00:04:11.520 --> 00:04:14.290
I bought a new digital camera!

00:04:14.290 --> 00:04:17.060
You've been wanting that
for a while, right, Tina?

00:04:19.400 --> 00:04:21.900
I can take lots of pictures of everyone.

00:04:21.900 --> 00:04:25.160
and when I go back, I can show
them to my papa and mama!

00:04:27.770 --> 00:04:29.910
U-Um, Tina-san?

00:04:29.910 --> 00:04:30.410
Hm?

00:04:30.780 --> 00:04:33.750
I don't mind you taking pictures.

00:04:34.550 --> 00:04:36.280
But this outfit is...

00:04:45.730 --> 00:04:48.970
When you talk about pictures,
you have to talk about cosplay!

00:04:49.860 --> 00:04:52.100
That's wrong, absolutely.

00:04:52.100 --> 00:04:54.130
I'm okay with it.

00:04:54.130 --> 00:04:55.900
Hooray! Hooray!

00:04:55.900 --> 00:04:57.860
Tina Nee-chan!

00:04:59.610 --> 00:05:00.740
Wait!

00:05:00.740 --> 00:05:03.030
Why am I the only one who's a hippo?

00:05:03.030 --> 00:05:04.650
It couldn't be helped.

00:05:04.650 --> 00:05:07.110
That's the only one that was left.

00:05:07.110 --> 00:05:10.240
All right, we'll start with Ooya-san{Miss Landlord} first!

00:05:12.290 --> 00:05:13.720
Hey, Ooya-san{Miss Landlord}.

00:05:13.720 --> 00:05:15.360
{Smile! Smile!}Laugh, laugh!

00:05:15.360 --> 00:05:16.170
Right.

00:05:16.460 --> 00:05:19.840
This is kind of embarrassing.

00:05:21.050 --> 00:05:22.900
Okay, here we go!

00:05:22.900 --> 00:05:24.390
Smile, smile!

00:05:28.400 --> 00:05:30.500
Okay, I'm going to take a lot!

00:05:30.500 --> 00:05:31.640
Yeah!

00:05:48.420 --> 00:05:51.360
That's very sexy, {Miss Manager}Kanrinin-san!

00:05:51.360 --> 00:05:54.130
Okay, try a leopardess pose next!

00:05:54.130 --> 00:05:55.370
Yay!

00:05:55.370 --> 00:05:57.330
A-A leopardess?

00:05:58.000 --> 00:05:59.570
L-Like this?

00:05:59.570 --> 00:06:00.790
Good, good!

00:06:01.200 --> 00:06:03.100
A nice leopardess!

00:06:06.510 --> 00:06:08.540
Okay, I'm going shopping.

00:06:08.540 --> 00:06:09.910
Ah, wait, Kaoru!

00:06:09.910 --> 00:06:11.210
I'll go, too!

00:06:31.240 --> 00:06:33.770
Hey, Tina.

00:06:33.770 --> 00:06:34.790
Geez!

00:06:35.300 --> 00:06:37.080
Daikon and...

00:06:37.080 --> 00:06:39.770
All right, this is all of it.

00:06:39.770 --> 00:06:41.460
Tina, we're going ba-

00:06:42.180 --> 00:06:44.170
Huh? Tina?

00:06:51.840 --> 00:06:55.010
The hell I've been telling you
that I'm not an <i>underdog</i>!

00:06:58.690 --> 00:06:59.890
Here! Here!

00:07:00.160 --> 00:07:01.390
Here! Here!

00:07:01.980 --> 00:07:03.810
Here! Here!

00:07:07.630 --> 00:07:09.700
Tina, we're going home.

00:07:09.700 --> 00:07:10.870
Kaoru?

00:07:10.870 --> 00:07:12.700
A little, just a little longer!

00:07:15.880 --> 00:07:19.910
Ah! I would've cleared it after a little more!

00:07:24.790 --> 00:07:26.020
Kaoru!

00:07:26.020 --> 00:07:27.510
Over here, over here!

00:07:30.160 --> 00:07:32.050
We made it at the best time.

00:07:33.830 --> 00:07:36.060
W-What is it, Tina?

00:07:36.630 --> 00:07:38.060
Look, over there.

00:07:49.040 --> 00:07:50.320
Heh!

00:07:51.180 --> 00:07:53.080
The scenery's nice, isn't it?

00:07:53.080 --> 00:07:55.200
I was thinking of taking a picture.

00:07:55.950 --> 00:07:56.780
I...

00:07:57.150 --> 00:07:59.740
really like the scenery here.

00:08:06.360 --> 00:08:11.220
The setting evening sun is similar to
the one where I lived a long time ago.

00:08:11.530 --> 00:08:13.900
Where you lived a long time ago...

00:08:13.900 --> 00:08:15.060
In Kyushu?

00:08:16.340 --> 00:08:17.970
No.

00:08:17.970 --> 00:08:19.270
In America.

00:08:22.910 --> 00:08:26.300
But I don't have many good memories here.

00:08:26.300 --> 00:08:27.980
Eh, why?

00:08:29.320 --> 00:08:32.950
When I got kind of sad
or something, I'd come here.

00:08:45.870 --> 00:08:47.460
Has something happened?

00:08:48.170 --> 00:08:49.870
No.

00:08:49.870 --> 00:08:51.210
That's not it.

00:08:52.440 --> 00:08:58.010
I was just thinking I had to make
a good memory here, too.

00:09:00.450 --> 00:09:01.820
I see.

00:09:01.820 --> 00:09:02.850
If that's all, that's fine, but...

00:09:03.780 --> 00:09:07.250
This is all after that. So, I was worried.

00:09:07.250 --> 00:09:08.190
<i>That?</i>

00:09:08.990 --> 00:09:11.690
The talk about going back home in America.

00:09:11.690 --> 00:09:14.060
Ah, that!

00:09:14.060 --> 00:09:15.930
You took it seriously?

00:09:15.930 --> 00:09:18.970
In your case, it might not have been a joke.

00:09:18.970 --> 00:09:20.910
You did this before, after all.

00:09:26.900 --> 00:09:27.670
Huh!

00:09:27.670 --> 00:09:28.330
Eh!

00:09:28.740 --> 00:09:30.340
I've spotted some cardboard!

00:09:30.840 --> 00:09:33.050
Let's slide on it together, Kaoru!

00:09:33.050 --> 00:09:35.010
S-Seriously, Tina?

00:09:35.010 --> 00:09:36.620
Come on, come on!

00:09:36.620 --> 00:09:39.390
Geez, there's no helping you.

00:09:39.390 --> 00:09:40.510
Okay, here we go!

00:09:43.020 --> 00:09:45.220
Yahoo!

00:09:57.940 --> 00:09:59.770
It's gotten colder.

00:09:59.770 --> 00:10:03.110
Okay, I'm going to go back to my room.

00:10:03.110 --> 00:10:03.700
Kaoru!

00:10:05.880 --> 00:10:07.780
Ah, no.

00:10:07.780 --> 00:10:09.130
It's nothing.

00:10:15.860 --> 00:10:16.840
Tina.

00:10:17.920 --> 00:10:19.000
Listen.

00:10:19.730 --> 00:10:23.760
Cut me a break on just up
and disappearing out of the blue.

00:10:25.000 --> 00:10:26.120
See you.

00:10:40.280 --> 00:10:42.580
I'm sorry, Kaoru.

00:10:44.320 --> 00:10:46.410
Right, is everyone doing okay?

00:10:47.790 --> 00:10:49.170
Thank goodness.

00:10:50.590 --> 00:10:52.630
Yeah, I'm fine. I'm fine.

00:10:52.630 --> 00:10:54.330
I said I'm okay.

00:10:54.330 --> 00:10:56.630
It's not as cold here as it is there.

00:10:57.000 --> 00:10:59.180
Yeah. I know.

00:10:59.900 --> 00:11:02.090
I promised that from the start.

00:11:02.870 --> 00:11:06.560
I can only stay in Japan while I'm in college.

00:11:07.170 --> 00:11:09.310
It's all right. I'll be sure to come home.

00:11:10.380 --> 00:11:11.940
To America!

00:11:13.610 --> 00:11:15.070
I can't say it.

00:11:15.850 --> 00:11:16.980
There's no way I can say.

00:11:18.080 --> 00:11:19.980
That we have to part soon.

00:11:21.020 --> 00:11:22.950
If I tell Kaoru that, I...

00:11:24.060 --> 00:11:27.370
I won't be able to stay as I am anymore.

00:11:33.470 --> 00:11:35.470
I love Kaoru.

00:11:35.470 --> 00:11:37.030
and I can't stop that.

00:11:39.570 --> 00:11:41.300
That's why I have to smile.

00:11:42.010 --> 00:11:44.220
I have to smile a lot.

00:11:46.650 --> 00:11:49.280
Laugh a lot with everyone.

00:11:49.280 --> 00:11:51.080
Make a lot of memories.

00:11:52.120 --> 00:11:53.690
After all...

00:11:53.690 --> 00:11:55.560
I...

00:11:55.560 --> 00:11:57.800
love everyone.

00:12:33.190 --> 00:12:35.810
Tae Nee-chan, hurry, hurry!

00:12:42.870 --> 00:12:45.610
A-Are you all right, Taeko-san?

00:12:46.700 --> 00:12:47.740
Y-Yes.

00:12:49.080 --> 00:12:51.080
Well then, we're off.

00:12:51.080 --> 00:12:53.210
Take care.

00:12:53.210 --> 00:12:56.410
Taeko-san, Chika-san, have a good new year.

00:12:56.410 --> 00:12:57.250
Right!

00:12:57.250 --> 00:13:00.000
Everyone, have a good new year!

00:13:00.000 --> 00:13:01.040
Goodbye!

00:13:02.920 --> 00:13:04.590
Tae-chin!

00:13:04.590 --> 00:13:05.710
Chika-rin!

00:13:08.890 --> 00:13:11.390
By the way, when are you going home?

00:13:11.390 --> 00:13:12.300
Eh?!

00:13:12.300 --> 00:13:13.770
A-Ah...

00:13:13.770 --> 00:13:16.090
I'll be going home in a while.

00:13:17.480 --> 00:13:20.230
Tae-chin! Chika-rin! Bye-bye!

00:13:20.230 --> 00:13:21.900
Bye-bye!

00:13:21.900 --> 00:13:22.960
Bye-bye!

00:13:24.780 --> 00:13:26.780
Are you all right, Chika-chan?

00:13:35.080 --> 00:13:37.380
Look, there are some of you, too.

00:13:48.720 --> 00:13:51.220
Tomorrow is the day, huh?

00:14:01.610 --> 00:14:02.480
Ooya-san{Miss Landlord}!

00:14:03.150 --> 00:14:05.400
Would you like some tea?

00:14:05.400 --> 00:14:08.160
I tried baking a cheesecake for the first time.

00:14:08.610 --> 00:14:11.490
I don't know if it will suit your tastes or not, though.

00:14:11.490 --> 00:14:13.100
If you like, please help yourself.

00:14:14.330 --> 00:14:15.370
Thank you!

00:14:17.540 --> 00:14:19.330
You've certainly taken a lot.

00:14:19.330 --> 00:14:20.830
Yeah.

00:14:20.830 --> 00:14:22.500
Would you like to look, too?

00:14:22.500 --> 00:14:24.070
Yes, certainly!

00:14:25.960 --> 00:14:27.760
This is from that time.

00:14:28.880 --> 00:14:31.680
Are pictures like this really okay?

00:14:31.680 --> 00:14:33.350
Of course.

00:14:33.350 --> 00:14:36.350
My papa and mama will be really happy.

00:14:36.350 --> 00:14:38.230
Oh, and...

00:14:38.230 --> 00:14:39.340
Tada!

00:14:39.340 --> 00:14:40.190
Heh!

00:14:40.190 --> 00:14:42.860
W-When did you take this?

00:14:44.820 --> 00:14:46.570
I have ones like this, too.

00:14:46.570 --> 00:14:47.490
Huh!

00:14:47.490 --> 00:14:49.860
I'm sure it'll surprise my papa and mama!

00:14:49.860 --> 00:14:51.870
Y-You can't show these!

00:14:52.660 --> 00:14:55.080
Why not? It's not like you're losing anything.

00:14:56.920 --> 00:14:58.790
Itadakimasu{Thank you for the food}!

00:15:02.710 --> 00:15:04.060
Ah!

00:15:04.060 --> 00:15:06.090
What's wrong, Tina?

00:15:06.090 --> 00:15:07.710
Aren't you hungry?

00:15:07.710 --> 00:15:08.770
Eh!

00:15:08.770 --> 00:15:11.770
No, that's not it.

00:15:11.770 --> 00:15:12.970
It's just...

00:15:13.600 --> 00:15:16.640
I was just thinking, with Tae-chin and Chika-rin gone,

00:15:16.640 --> 00:15:19.560
it's gotten pretty quiet around here.

00:15:21.600 --> 00:15:26.420
Somehow, it feels like dear family members have gone away.

00:15:26.420 --> 00:15:27.820
It's kind of lonely.

00:15:27.820 --> 00:15:29.890
Right.

00:15:29.890 --> 00:15:33.780
Tae-chin and Chika-rin are dear family members.

00:15:34.330 --> 00:15:37.460
If they aren't around, then it really is lonely.

00:15:37.460 --> 00:15:38.300
That's why...

00:15:38.660 --> 00:15:39.870
That's why...

00:15:43.770 --> 00:15:45.570
Tonight, let's drink!

00:15:45.570 --> 00:15:47.500
Drink and make merry!

00:15:47.500 --> 00:15:50.140
She says she's lonely.

00:15:50.140 --> 00:15:52.370
But the truth is she just wants to drink.

00:15:54.710 --> 00:15:56.400
There, there, there!

00:16:06.400 --> 00:16:08.020
All right.

00:16:13.100 --> 00:16:14.860
And this finishes it.

00:16:30.850 --> 00:16:32.650
Listen.

00:16:32.650 --> 00:16:36.970
Cut me a break on just up
and disappearing out of the blue.

00:16:48.200 --> 00:16:49.530
Kaoru?

00:16:49.530 --> 00:16:50.930
Are you awake?

00:16:59.440 --> 00:17:01.620
There's no way you'd be...

00:17:03.510 --> 00:17:05.280
Let's talk for a little bit.

00:17:09.320 --> 00:17:10.620
It's okay, right?

00:17:10.620 --> 00:17:14.470
After all, this is my final bit of selfishness.

00:17:17.130 --> 00:17:18.900
I'm sorry.

00:17:18.900 --> 00:17:20.430
I'm sorry, Kaoru.

00:17:22.030 --> 00:17:24.130
Actually, I...

00:17:24.130 --> 00:17:26.500
can't stay in Japan anymore.

00:17:26.500 --> 00:17:28.870
I have to go back to America.

00:17:29.470 --> 00:17:30.570
Because...

00:17:31.840 --> 00:17:34.650
I said I'd come back home when I graduated.

00:17:34.650 --> 00:17:38.810
That's what I promised my papa
and mama when I came to Japan

00:17:39.850 --> 00:17:42.910
After I go home, I probably can't come back...

00:17:45.060 --> 00:17:46.820
Kaoru.

00:17:46.820 --> 00:17:52.710
I wanted to know more, more about you.

00:17:52.710 --> 00:17:56.630
I wanted to make more happy memories with you.

00:17:57.500 --> 00:17:59.010
And I wanted you...

00:17:59.800 --> 00:18:03.350
to know more, even more about me.

00:18:06.380 --> 00:18:07.730
But...

00:18:07.730 --> 00:18:10.080
But, the truth is...

00:18:13.580 --> 00:18:15.420
I don't want to go home.

00:18:15.420 --> 00:18:17.780
I don't want to go home, Kaoru.

00:18:18.360 --> 00:18:19.890
I want to stay with you.

00:18:19.890 --> 00:18:22.290
Forever, from now on, always...

00:18:23.260 --> 00:18:26.330
After all, Kaoru, I...

00:18:26.330 --> 00:18:27.630
Kaoru, I...

00:19:00.260 --> 00:19:01.660
Aoi-chan.

00:19:26.460 --> 00:19:27.310
Ah!

00:19:32.400 --> 00:19:33.260
Tina-san?

00:19:33.260 --> 00:19:35.830
O-Ooya-san{M-Miss Landlord}!

00:19:35.830 --> 00:19:38.270
What are you doing so early in the morning?

00:19:38.270 --> 00:19:39.280
Cleaning.

00:19:39.740 --> 00:19:42.200
I always do the cleaning at this time of day.

00:19:42.200 --> 00:19:46.030
Eh! Ooya-san{Miss Landlord}, you wake up this early every day?

00:19:47.540 --> 00:19:51.670
Tina-san, could it be that you're going home today?

00:19:51.670 --> 00:19:52.850
Eh!

00:19:52.850 --> 00:19:56.220
Y-Yeah, it's an early flight.

00:19:56.220 --> 00:19:59.170
And I didn't want to wake
everyone to see me off.

00:19:59.170 --> 00:20:01.360
Is that so?

00:20:01.360 --> 00:20:05.850
Ah, Ooya-san{Miss Landlord}, sorry about this, please take care of Uzume.

00:20:06.260 --> 00:20:08.070
I've been away a long time.

00:20:08.070 --> 00:20:10.800
And need to spend quality time with my papa and mama.

00:20:10.800 --> 00:20:12.770
So I might be there awhile.

00:20:12.770 --> 00:20:15.310
Yes, that's no problem at all.

00:20:15.310 --> 00:20:16.670
Thank goodness.

00:20:17.710 --> 00:20:19.280
Then I'm off.

00:20:19.680 --> 00:20:22.650
Have a good trip, and have a good new year.

00:20:23.250 --> 00:20:24.820
You too, Ooya-san{Miss Landlord}.

00:20:24.820 --> 00:20:25.820
Bye-bye!

00:20:29.190 --> 00:20:30.500
Bye-bye!

00:22:36.110 --> 00:22:38.940
Spring comes,
faces summer,

00:22:38.940 --> 00:22:42.000
becomes autumn, then goes on into winter.

00:22:42.490 --> 00:22:45.560
That is the continuing cycle of the seasons.

00:22:45.560 --> 00:22:49.800
As time goes on, we can
never return to this time again.

00:22:49.800 --> 00:22:52.290
The path of a new journey opens up.

00:22:53.160 --> 00:22:58.600
Now let us go and look for
the eternal flower in that heart.

00:22:59.240 --> 00:23:01.100
Ai Yori Aoshi Enishi,

00:23:01.100 --> 00:23:02.560
the final episode is...

00:23:03.410 --> 00:23:04.810
Bonds.
